      "content": "i know i should call them but my doctor is out of the office until monday and i really dont want to pay for an urgent care visit if i dont have to. it's just a little discomfort, nothing crazy. if i just took a normal dose like 100mg twice a day would that be okay for a few days until i can talk to them? i just want to stop the burning now.",
