    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "urgh okay i get it. but like, if i decide not to take the macrobid, is there any way to just flush it out of my system naturally? i read online that mega doses of vitamin c can kill bacteria in the bladder. would like 2000mg or 3000mg of vitamin c be safe enough to help with the infection since it's safer for my kidneys than meds? i really just want to avoid the doctor if i can help it.",
